sequenceDiagram
  participant P as site A: primary image
  participant D as rbd-mirror at site B
  participant N as site B: non-primary image
  Note over P: schedule: rbd mirror snapshot schedule add 15m
  P->>P: create mirror snapshot S2 (state=PRIMARY, peer_uuids={B})
  D->>P: scan_remote_mirror_snapshots: S1 (synced) and S2 (new)
  D->>N: create_non_primary_snapshot S2' (complete=false, primary_snap_id=S2)
  D->>P: copy_image: deep-copy the S1..S2 difference (with object map / diff)
  P-->>D: changed blocks
  D->>N: write the difference, update last_copied_object_number
  D->>N: apply_image_state (size, metadata) and complete=true
  D->>P: unlink_peer from S1 (S1 becomes deletable)
